  "comment": "A series of illustration works by Dilla Anbar, better known as Bagongtempur, one-half of Bandung-based zinemaker Cucukrowo Mekgejin. Sebelum Cebok di Jepang features Dilla's artwork inspired by Japanese pop culture–especially Heta-Uma–created just before he finally flew to Japan for work. The title can be translated as: \"Before I cleaned myself–after using the toilet–in Japan\"",
